	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Eiusdem amicitię est, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> compater <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>in domino charissime, compati adflictis et <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>congaudere gaudentibus, et hanc ob causam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>consueverunt veri amici non solum, quę <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>lęta, sed et quę tristia accidunt, percupide <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>inter se communicare.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Hoc amicitię affectu <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>motus non possum dolorem cordis mei <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>cohibere, quin illum humanitati tuę significem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Quamvis multa sint in misera hac et calamitosa <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tempestate, quę animum meum subinde perturbant, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>accessit tamen ad illorum cumulum haud <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mediocris dolor ex casu filii mei <persName ref="p8416">Abrahę</persName> prae<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>teritis diebus conceptus, quem nondum, ut <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cupio, excutere possum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Decima octava mensis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>huius circa duodecimam meridianam, cum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>musaeolo suo egrederetur et gradus ad cellam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>vinariam in ingressu domus, loco admodum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>periculoso et incommodo, descendentes aperto <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ostio paterent, per imprudentiam et incircum<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>spectionem sic in illos e sublimi pavimento <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>prolapsus est, ut crus dextrum supra genu <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>infęlicicausa perfregerit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Chirurgum nactus <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>sum nondum, ut metuo, satis in hac arte <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>exercitatum; est enim aetate iunior, quam ut <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>singularem aliquam harum rerum peritiam assequi potuerit; <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>pollicetur tamen, ut solent, curaturum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>se, ut malum hoc quam commodissime et rectissi<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>me tollatur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nihilo tamen minus hinc dolore <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ex calamitate filii, illinc metu ex chirurgi <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>imperitio torqueor.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed domino sit gratia: iam <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>quartus dies est elapsus et malum sic curari <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>videtur, ut nihil ex eo futurum sit incommodi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Habes de tristibus, quę me premunt; accipe <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>iam lętiora: hodie hora octava promeridiana <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>enixa est uxor, initio quidem admodum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>difficulter, tandem vero feliciter; peperit <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>autem filium, quem cras a concione volente <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>domino sacro baptismate ecclesię fidelium et electorum <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>associandum et consecrandum dabimus; nomen <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>illius erit <persName ref="p2207">Ioannes Heinrychus</persName> a compatribus <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>sumptum, quos te et D. <persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName>, sicuti volebas, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>ad id sacri delegimus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Oro dominum, ut utriusque <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>pietatem et eruditionem infans hic suo tempore <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>per ipsius gratiam, si non prorsus exprimere poterit <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>e vestigio, saltem subsequatur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dominus te ac tuos <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>omnes una cum reliquis dominis ac fratribus salvos <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>et incolumes conservet.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant vos omnes <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>uxor et liberi ac frequenter optant, ut <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>aliquando pristinę consuetudinis solatia <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>coram renovare liceat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Optime vale, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>compater in domino charissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 21. septembris <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><persName ref="p8417">W[olfgangus] Musculus</persName>, compa<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ter tuus, amantissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Praes<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>tanti th<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>eologo M. <lb xml:id="p2z11"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullinge<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ro</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae ant<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>istiti vigilantissimo, c<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>ompatri suo in <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Christo charissim.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
